{
  "slug": "hotmarks",
  "name": "Hotmarks",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Semantic formatting plugin that gives your prompts weight. Type **bold** to mark non-negotiable directives — Claude must follow them exactly. Type __underline__ to mark critical emphasis — Claude prioritizes them\n  above everything else. A prompt-submit hook automatically detects markers, skips code blocks, and injects structured semantic context. Three modes (reminder, transform, both), configurable via .hotmarks file, zero\n  runtime dependencies.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `semantic-formatting` (Detect and respect semantic formatting markers in prompts)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hotmarks@claude-community` from `AdhamHossamm/HotMarks-forClaudeCode`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 2
  },
